{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDY1wkK97h31RS5ZdrTc", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：Harald Haas（哈拉尔德·哈斯）**，爱丁堡大学移动通信教授。他在 2011 年 TEDGlobal 的演讲 \"Wireless Data from Every Light Bulb\" 中，用 LED 灯演示了可见光传输数据，并提出了 \"Li-Fi\" 这个说法。\n\n这次只搜了 1 次。结果里的演讲标题、演示内容等细节是搜索摘要给的，我没有逐一打开页面核对。\n\nSources:\n- [Li-Fi - Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Li-Fi)\n- [Harald Haas - pureLiFi](https://lifi.co/harald-haas/)\n- [Physics World: the revolutionary potential of LiFi](https://physicsworld.com/a/how-big-ideas-can-change-the-world-the-revolutionary-potential-of-lifi/)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1120, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4315, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1120}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:03:48.659Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDY1wSUCrZizVSKtRVHB"}
